<title>USA: Nesbitt Burns Securities to open office in Houston.</title>
<headline>Nesbitt Burns Securities to open office in Houston.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nesbitt Burns Securities Inc said Tuesday it will open an office in Houston to provide investment banking services to clients in the oil and gas sector.</p>
<p>Nesbitt Burns Securities Inc is an affiliate of Nesbitt Burns Inc, Canada's largest investment bank.</p>
</text>
